    "detailed_description": "Complete missions to save a world devastated by zombies, utilizing Arm Units and special abilities! Throw Anything: Radiation Zombies is a third-person shooter 3D-action roguelite game set in a world overrun by zombies, where you survive by throwing objects around. Equip a powerful Arm Unit, enhance yourself with a personalized skill tree, and explore a maze-like world!<br><br>\u25a0 Combine various items obtained in the field to engage in battles in diverse ways!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634850/extras/a140efa437c811e2103030255370a142.poster.avif?t=1724898234\" width=588 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634850/extras/a140efa437c811e2103030255370a142.webm?t=1724898234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634850/extras/a140efa437c811e2103030255370a142.mp4?t=1724898234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0 If there are no nearby objects to throw, try to reverse challenging situations through unique skills!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634850/extras/dba2e0c0299867cc173436d29476e4a7.poster.avif?t=1724898234\" width=588 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634850/extras/dba2e0c0299867cc173436d29476e4a7.webm?t=1724898234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634850/extras/dba2e0c0299867cc173436d29476e4a7.mp4?t=1724898234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0 Defeat zombies, earn points, and strengthen your character in your own style!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_